= California Northstate University College of Medicine - Prompt 02

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Education Not Continuous
- Limit: No word count specified in latest public prompt set
- Cycle used in this repo: 2024-2025 latest public SDN prompt set
- Source: https://www.studentdoctor.net/schools-database/medical-school/essay-questions/CAL-NO
