#section_label("Prompt text")
If your education has not been continuous since high school, please explain why. Examples of discontinuities include time taken off while obtaining your undergraduate degree, in addition to gap years.

#section_label("Shared backbone files")
- typst/shared/gap-year.typ
- typst/shared/academic-context.typ

#section_label("gap-year backbone")
= Gap Year / Current Year Backbone

== Timeline
List work, service, research, coursework, and personal commitments in order.

== Purpose
Explain why this year matters for your development, not just what you are doing.

== Connection to Medicine
- Skills built
- Exposure deepened
- Perspective gained
#section_label("academic-context backbone")
= Academic Context Backbone

== Context
State the issue plainly: low grades, withdrawals, extended timeline, or a break.

== Accountability
Own what is yours without overexplaining.

== Recovery
- What changed?
- What evidence shows improvement?
- What habits or systems are now different?

